{"3823130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "YetiParty", "steam_appid": 3823130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the absurd world of the parody horror game “YetiParty.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an unmatched walking simulator set in a Russian village (now with a pinch of realism!).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pick up items and carry them in your hands — <i>revolutionary gameplay</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some assets you've definitely never seen in other games (but let’s be honest — you probably have).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on Unreal Engine 5, which, surprisingly, didn’t improve the quality at all.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/888bab25958e20ba0b1dcc9ce71ce98d.poster.avif?t=1765847664\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/888bab25958e20ba0b1dcc9ce71ce98d.webm?t=1765847664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/888bab25958e20ba0b1dcc9ce71ce98d.mp4?t=1765847664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a first-year student named Pyodor. His parents couldn’t choose between Fyodor and Pyotr, so they went with a compromise. To celebrate getting into university, Pyodor and his friends head to a remote Russian village to party. But things take a turn when an ancient evil awakens deep in the forest… Oh, and three local thugs really want to steal your phone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/1dd3c6bcef5fd639f0bbfc371a86a0cd.poster.avif?t=1765847664\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/1dd3c6bcef5fd639f0bbfc371a86a0cd.webm?t=1765847664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/1dd3c6bcef5fd639f0bbfc371a86a0cd.mp4?t=1765847664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Feed the rabbits, grab some beers, and maybe try to lose your virginity to your friend’s hot sister. Otherwise, a bloodthirsty Yeti might mount you on his hairy… you know what. So party hard — before night falls.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/943ca5798f1bcff78e3a05f6a526aad3.poster.avif?t=1765847664\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/943ca5798f1bcff78e3a05f6a526aad3.webm?t=1765847664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/943ca5798f1bcff78e3a05f6a526aad3.mp4?t=1765847664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(<i>Yes, it’s actually... special.</i>)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low-effort jokes and filthy punchlines written by wannabe Tarantinos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cutting-edge dialogue system that affects absolutely nothing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll laugh. You'll scream. It’s like two games for the price of one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient memes, loud profanity, and proudly dumb stereotypes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A killer soundtrack featuring such legendary hits as:<br><i>“And the Cranes Flew Over the River Outpost”</i><br><i>“My Python Is Ready for Love”</i><br><i>“18 Seconds of Passion”</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/89a329d86fb48afc18eff385255973bf.poster.avif?t=1765847664\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/89a329d86fb48afc18eff385255973bf.webm?t=1765847664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/89a329d86fb48afc18eff385255973bf.mp4?t=1765847664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As a bonus, the game also includes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1) Cringe-worthy Russian voice acting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2) Plot twists straight out of <i>DuckTales</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3) A chance to fix Uncle Kolya’s car (whoever the hell that is).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4) A good ol’ punch in the face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But the most important thing is the story that <i>YetiParty</i> has to offer.</strong><br><br><br><strong>A coming-of-age tale. A story of love. A story of life itself...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who are we kidding — it’s pure chaos and unfiltered degeneracy!<br>You’ve been warned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game lasts approximately 60 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the absurd world of the parody horror game “YetiParty.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an unmatched walking simulator set in a Russian village (now with a pinch of realism!).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pick up items and carry them in your hands — <i>revolutionary gameplay</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some assets you've definitely never seen in other games (but let’s be honest — you probably have).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on Unreal Engine 5, which, surprisingly, didn’t improve the quality at all.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/888bab25958e20ba0b1dcc9ce71ce98d.poster.avif?t=1765847664\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/888bab25958e20ba0b1dcc9ce71ce98d.webm?t=1765847664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/888bab25958e20ba0b1dcc9ce71ce98d.mp4?t=1765847664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a first-year student named Pyodor. His parents couldn’t choose between Fyodor and Pyotr, so they went with a compromise. To celebrate getting into university, Pyodor and his friends head to a remote Russian village to party. But things take a turn when an ancient evil awakens deep in the forest… Oh, and three local thugs really want to steal your phone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/1dd3c6bcef5fd639f0bbfc371a86a0cd.poster.avif?t=1765847664\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/1dd3c6bcef5fd639f0bbfc371a86a0cd.webm?t=1765847664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/1dd3c6bcef5fd639f0bbfc371a86a0cd.mp4?t=1765847664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Feed the rabbits, grab some beers, and maybe try to lose your virginity to your friend’s hot sister. Otherwise, a bloodthirsty Yeti might mount you on his hairy… you know what. So party hard — before night falls.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/943ca5798f1bcff78e3a05f6a526aad3.poster.avif?t=1765847664\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/943ca5798f1bcff78e3a05f6a526aad3.webm?t=1765847664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/943ca5798f1bcff78e3a05f6a526aad3.mp4?t=1765847664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(<i>Yes, it’s actually... special.</i>)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low-effort jokes and filthy punchlines written by wannabe Tarantinos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cutting-edge dialogue system that affects absolutely nothing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll laugh. You'll scream. It’s like two games for the price of one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient memes, loud profanity, and proudly dumb stereotypes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A killer soundtrack featuring such legendary hits as:<br><i>“And the Cranes Flew Over the River Outpost”</i><br><i>“My Python Is Ready for Love”</i><br><i>“18 Seconds of Passion”</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/89a329d86fb48afc18eff385255973bf.poster.avif?t=1765847664\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/89a329d86fb48afc18eff385255973bf.webm?t=1765847664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/89a329d86fb48afc18eff385255973bf.mp4?t=1765847664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As a bonus, the game also includes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1) Cringe-worthy Russian voice acting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2) Plot twists straight out of <i>DuckTales</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3) A chance to fix Uncle Kolya’s car (whoever the hell that is).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4) A good ol’ punch in the face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But the most important thing is the story that <i>YetiParty</i> has to offer.</strong><br><br><br><strong>A coming-of-age tale. A story of love. A story of life itself...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who are we kidding — it’s pure chaos and unfiltered degeneracy!<br>You’ve been warned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game lasts approximately 60 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A first-person parody horror. College goofballs are partying hard in the great outdoors - booze, boobs, and bad decisions. What's gonna kill 'em first? Cheap vodka, ancient memes, dirty jokes… or a bloodthirsty Yeti from the woods?", "supported_languages": "English, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/abc652b09d9d280f72a782739126d47607781b95/header.jpg?t=1765847664", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/2e4aba5377d4e9173e438a02c2e9ce679e80faab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765847664", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/2e4aba5377d4e9173e438a02c2e9ce679e80faab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765847664", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> WINDOWS 10, 11 (64-BIT)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5-3470 or AMD Ryzen™ 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 760 2GB / AMD Radeon R9 280 3GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> WINDOWS 10, 11 (64-BIT)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i7-3770 or AMD FX™-9590 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 1060 or AMD Radeon™ RX 480 with 3GB Video RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements"